 "notes": "Old kinds kept one-to-one. Ink reorganised as maker → line (archetype) → named colours (versions); Pilot Iroshizuku range kept as an archetype. Cartridges and converters kept as types plus a short model list (no SKU dumps); nibs get JoWo, Bock and Schmidt unit archetypes. Not added for lack of a retrieved page: Montblanc, Kaweco and Sailor Studio ink lines, Diamine Shimmertastic and named Diamine colours, Pelikan 4001 Blue-Black and Brilliant Black, Iroshizuku colours beyond four, Pelikan nib units. No traditions (inks and nibs are industrial). Brand facts for Pelikan, Noodler's, De Atramentis, JoWo, Bock and Schmidt from knowledge; unknown founding years left blank. unsharpen.com blocked; pelikan-collectibles empty; pelikan mam 503; purepens Noodler's page 404."
